 Changes=0A=0AScore=0A=0AAction=0A=0ASupplier A / Single-source bearing=0A=
=0ACritical=0A=0ASep 12 / Aug 28=0A=0A6 days=0A=0A2=0A=0A34=0A=0AContact su=
